    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer proudly brings to the market for sale this stunning A-Rated four bedroom semi-detached property situated in the hugely popular Castle Heights development in Carrigaline.\r\n\r\nThis much sought after 4 bed house type comes to the market in turnkey condition with an eye-catching finish combined with its hugely impressive open plan kitchen/dining/living room layout. It is evident walking through plenty of thought was given to its many features such as its extensive modern fitted kitchen it integrated appliances, built in wardrobes and storage units, fully tiled bathrooms to name a few. \r\n\r\nOutside, it has a nice enclosed rear garden with a secure side pedestrian gate and features a nice decking area and a Steeltech shed on a concrete base. It offers good privacy enjoying a nice peaceful setting and to the front, it has a cobble-lock driveway with parking for two cars. \r\n\r\nThe property is most conveniently located just a short distance to all amenities and services in Carrigaline and is only a short commute to Cork City Centre, Cork Airport & Ringaskiddy. It also has easy access to a regular public bus service available close-by and has easy access onto the hugely popular Carrigaline-Crosshaven walk-way. \r\n\r\nViewing of this modern quality home in a much sought after park comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 5.44m x 2.33m \r\nComposite front door with glazing, LVT flooring, centre light, carpet stairway, modern built-in under stair storage units with fridge. \r\n\r\nGuest WC - 1.56m x 1.61m \r\nTile floor, tile wall, WC, vanity unit, built in storage unit, centre globe light. \r\n\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Dining/Living Area - 7.72m x 6.94m \r\nExtensive modern fitted kitchen unit with integrated double oven, electric hob with splashback, overhead extractor unit, dishwasher, fridge/freezer, large centre island. Recessed lighting/centre light, LVT flooring, French doors to rear garden\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 2.8m x 1.62m \r\nLVT flooring, side door, extensive floor to ceiling units, plumbed for washing machine and dryer. \r\n\r\nSitting Room - 4.49m x 4.35m \r\nLVT flooring, centre light, inserted stove with surround, feature stone chimney breast, centre light, window blind. \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding Area - 4.29m x 2.55m \r\nCarpet/LVT flooring, centre light, linen press with shelving, stira stairs leading to overhead attic. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.45m x 3.14m \r\nCarpet floor, centre light, large modern slider robe unit, curtains. \r\n\r\nEn Suite - 2.42m x 0.98m \r\nTile floor, WC, vanity unit with tile surround, fitted wall cabinet with mirror, power shower unit with chrome enclosure and tile surround, centre globe light. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.08m x 3.47m \r\nLVT flooring, built in bunk bed unit, centre light, curtains\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.48m x 2.74m \r\nLVT flooring, centre light, curtains. \r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 3.05m x 2.78m \r\nLVT flooring, curtain pole, curtains, centre light, fitted fold out wall bed. \r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.5m x 1.84m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, WC, double basin vanity unit, large wall mirror, centre globe light, chrome heated towel rail, large bath unit with rainfall shower head and chrome enclosure. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: c. 145.5 sq metres (1,565 sq ft)\r\nPVC Double Glazed Windows & Doors\r\nAir to Water Heat Pump\r\nSpacious open plan kitchen/dining/living area\r\nSuperb decorative condition throughout\r\nReady for immediate occupation\r\nExtensive modern fitted kitchen with integrated appliances \r\nPrivate enclosed rear garden with secure side pedestrian gate\r\nTimber decking area & Steeltech shed on concrete base\r\nHugely popular & sought after residential location\r\nMinutes’ to all amenities and services in Carrigaline\r\nEasy access to a regular public bus service \r\nShort drive to Cork City Centre, Ringaskiddy & Cork Airport"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A2"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Carrigaline, continue through the main street taking a right at The Corner House Bar. Continue out this road for approximately 1 mile until you come to the roundabout taking a left into Castle Heights.  Upon entering the estate, take your 2nd left into Fern Dale and No.9 is situated along here on the right handside, indicated by our \"For Sale\" sign. Follow P43 EC67"
      }
